<speak>Yes, a simple note saying to have my usual folder ready would be helpful. I know where that lives now, so I won't need to carry everything from the study. Also, please allow me to say when I need a pause. Sometimes I don't want a question repeated; I just need a few seconds to finish writing. I feel awkward leaving silence on a call and start talking too soon. Today has been easier because you've left the space instead of assuming the line has gone dead.</speak>